nId":"x_0f76fc3dc1a09b8c345e","language":"ja","text":"【句動】出す, 公開する / 消える,を消す / （見たり使ったりするために）を置く","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_15657b37db82a683716f","expressionId":"x_e5d3891501d0164a9746","language":"ja","text":"《話》急げ / おいで / （励まして）さあ,がんばれ,大丈夫だ / （納得がいかなくて）おいおい / （ねだって）お願いだよ / （挑発して）さあ来い / （明かりが）つく","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_6c348c25a4fbe235643e","expressionId":"x_efc254afbc0ca262f349","language":"ja","text":"【句動】姿を現す,参加する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_544ac4bbd61341ba0e26","expressionId":"x_0353699cc1f5f1d211b2","language":"ja","text":"【句動】自制する,控える / を押さえつける,を抑制する / をくい止める,を引き止める / をこらえる,を抑える","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_135f814eeabfba7bfddd","expressionId":"x_d5201236a8320664f0bd","language":"ja","text":"ただし...ならば,  ...という条件で","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_e01ffc19578d76b6de26","expressionId":"x_77d88943c0b4f00ffe6e","language":"ja","text":"(窮状などを救う)解決法 / 《英》(劇場などの)出口([[exit]])","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_b248a441864ef9f818a5","expressionId":"x_be4c870e08b57c2d98ba","language":"ja","text":"《…に》 間に合うように《to do/for》/ 《just ~》ちょうど間に合って / やがては, そのうちに, いずれ","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_0586fae7874b12f4b84a","expressionId":"x_c24d9e1ed30b3239bcfd","language":"ja","text":"《at ~》現在のところ / 《in ~》この段階において","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_66cf17a80d627713f8c3","expressionId":"x_b61dfe87ea7bcb0f58bb","language":"ja","text":"ときどき, 時には","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_af8921e587968bbe0fac","expressionId":"x_e45cc567c10a4ad7416b","language":"ja","text":"...であることが判明する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_eda5b3c9ead99b3272c0","expressionId":"x_35c66137399d792d3424","language":"ja","text":"《驚く》あら, まあ / 《残念》 やれやれ,あらら","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_4bddd3ad7b3fc599df1c","expressionId":"x_8646c7da74aa67ea336f","language":"ja","text":"《副詞的に》それ以後ずっと /  《前置詞･接続詞的に》…してからずっと","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_2f587526ef20b8b9a4bf","expressionId":"x_576a9d9a817cd2f78187","language":"ja","text":"【フレーズ】〜の問題","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_a437fc99fed10441c6ae","expressionId":"x_452f55b0a0c71bbda937","language":"ja","text":"ちょっとした...., 相当の...","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_0b5e4df94d0caca8344a","expressionId":"x_a81161c8d092c02cae05","language":"ja","text":"...に裏付けられた, ...に証明された / ...に支援された / 《be ~ ...》の後ろに...がある","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_55f975c246c642ccc8c8","expressionId":"x_0e48febf0efadd5bb289","language":"ja","text":"置く、泊める、提供する、（見えるように）を取り付ける, （壁などに）を貼る / ...を大目に見る《with ...》/ を建てる、を置く","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_7d948b87d6bd60bc31bc","expressionId":"x_c939ab243d5ef12f6976","language":"ja","text":"最初, 出だし/ 《at ~》最初に,最初は","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_8738fa125396bb950288","expressionId":"x_8df3f7494545869f2dff","language":"ja","text":"（その間中）ずっと, いつも / 《接続詞的に》…の間はずっと / 年がら年中, 四六時中","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_af7cfd90287d7ab8c3f1","expressionId":"x_6ead4d7864bab5550734","language":"ja","text":"そのような... / とても /《強調》なんて...のような","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_5d42be45d3668d8f209f","expressionId":"x_c09e5b47390101ab70d2","language":"ja","text":"《...と》連絡を取りあって《with ...》 / 《（事情）に》通じて《with ...》 / 《...と》接触して《with ...》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_3f04ce6313609ddc7942","expressionId":"x_398b8fc0599794b26266","language":"ja","text":"（仕事などを）をうまくこなす / （中断していた事）を続ける / （やろうと思っていた事）を始める","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_2811a332014be4d8daa5","expressionId":"x_2fdd5e8ef5411912cff4","language":"ja","text":"じつは,実際には / つまり,もっとはっきり言えば / それどころか, いやむしろ","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_a81c69788b070b92c53f","expressionId":"x_d7411f04d55d30d51b5f","language":"ja","text":"をみつけだす, をつきとめる","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_41f364813bc9a29baac5","expressionId":"x_714c0c3c3ea1120d7503","language":"ja","text":"（人）に訴える, 《Aが》《...する》ように懇願する《to A to do》 / 《...を》（人）に求める,要請する《for ...》  /  ...に魅力がある, ...の興味を惹く","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_132fc56a270a6291ea5b","expressionId":"x_b9cbb04514df9f7e85bd","language":"ja","text":"《...に》最終的になる《as ...》 / 《...に》最終的に入る《in ...》 / 最終的に《...》することになる《(by) doing》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_cd215815e4f0724a2ba9","expressionId":"x_26b7d64c9a20c9e830d6","language":"ja","text":"たった（数量）, ...だけ / Bでないと同様Aでない《A than B》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_f9d962e4630dd798ffea","expressionId":"x_0649f60c6194593c763a","language":"ja","text":"いくらか, 多かれ少なかれ / だいたい, ほとんど / およそ, 約","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_f78cfeb3989fd48fae28","expressionId":"x_9f2bc7108cc435a0bc81","language":"ja","text":"を脱ぐ / 急に場所を離れる / 地面を離れて上昇する,離陸する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_fbe99164188b8a7f1433","expressionId":"x_75a5d7819c60445b46e6","language":"ja","text":"《...に》出発する《for ...》,《...し》始める《to do》/ を爆発させる,（警報など）を鳴らす/ のきっかけとなる,（意図せずに）を引き起こす","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_6798facb5bd7eb5965da","expressionId":"x_ee01b18f85735bd91394","language":"ja","text":"（合計で金額・数量が）...に達する, ...になる / （言動・状況などが）...も同然である, 要するに...に等しい/ （人・言動の価値が）...になる","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_26d2c6e735478ab539e9","expressionId":"x_61049028b52ca4f8e05b","language":"ja","text":"《be ~》...によって経営される, ...によって切り盛りされる","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_8f0f0b04b9d4a793395a","expressionId":"x_bd74433083ccd97c309e","language":"ja","text":"【副】やがて, 時が経つにつれ / ゆっくりと時間をかけて, 徐々に","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_416deae585e4fbf90cd6","expressionId":"x_61a4a10518cb0a2b290f","language":"ja","text":"《be ~ 》...に反対している, ...に向かい合っている","source":"PHRASE"}]